usage: cpu_validation.py [-h]
                         [--stage {all,regression,generate,coverage,evaluation,circle,replay,_fixtures,_connected,_tests}]
                         --output OUTPUT [--seed SEED] [--fixtures FIXTURES]
                         [--baseline-repo BASELINE_REPO] [--evidence EVIDENCE]
                         [--repo REPO] [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT]
                         [--artifacts ARTIFACTS]

Run download-free CPU recipe checks, including real saved Circle execution.
Invoke with ``python -m tico.quantization.recipes.debug.cpu_validation`` from
an installed development checkout. Each invocation requires a new output
directory. All original child exit codes, configurations and logs remain
available there.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --stage {all,regression,generate,coverage,evaluation,circle,replay,_fixtures,_connected,_tests}
  --output OUTPUT
  --seed SEED
  --fixtures FIXTURES   Reuse trusted local frozen fixtures without
                        recalibrating.
  --baseline-repo BASELINE_REPO
                        Baseline checkout for same-checkpoint exporter
                        comparison.
  --evidence EVIDENCE   Original connected-run evidence directory for replay.
  --repo REPO           Checkout providing the imported TICO package for
                        replay.
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
                        Trusted frozen checkpoint for connected execution or
                        replay.
  --artifacts ARTIFACTS
                        Directory of saved Circle stages for connected
                        execution or replay.
